# ---- Render artifacts -------------------------------------------------------
# The Higgsfield masters and extracted frames are large (~193 MB) and fully
# reproducible from build/*.txt prompts + build/10_render.sh. Committing them
# would grow history permanently on every re-render.
#
# The PROMPTS and SCRIPTS in build/ ARE tracked — those are the source of truth.
build/*.mp4
build/*.png
build/*.json
build/*.err
build/draft720/
build/poster_*.png

# ---- Source imagery ---------------------------------------------------------
# Original logo/banner PNGs (~11 MB). The web-optimised derivatives live in
# site/assets/ and are tracked. Un-ignore if you want the originals versioned.
Images/

# ---- Local tooling ----------------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
*.log

# npx side-effects from running wrangler. Nothing here is needed — deploys use
# `npx wrangler@3` explicitly. Note the auto-written package.json pins wrangler ^4,
# which requires Node 22 and will NOT run on Node 20; don't treat it as the source
# of truth for the deploy toolchain. Safe to delete node_modules (~177 MB) anytime.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
